[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "よーしよし、順調に動いてるね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alright, everything's working just as planned!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ベップ、１杯いっとく？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Want a cup, Bepp?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いただきます。ごく……ごく……ごく……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Thank you... *gulp* *gulp* *gulp*"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "どう？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん。美味しいわ。突き抜けるような爽快感",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes. It's delicious. Such a crisp, refreshing taste."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "やたっ！\u3000成功だね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes! Success!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "これでも、街全体の水を賄うには足りなそうだけど……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Still, this won't be enough water to supply the entire city..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "同じ装置をたくさん用意するつもり。元になる海水は\nいくらでもあるし、装置さえ増やせば大丈夫！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We'll just make lots of these devices. There's plenty of seawater, so as long as we have enough purifiers, we'll be fine!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ただ、さすがに神官長に話は通さないといけないね。\n今、その道筋を綿密に考えて……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Though I should probably run this by the High Priest first. I'm working on the best way to approach that..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふむ。ろ過装置の実験は成功したようだな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmm. I see the filtration device experiment was successful."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アウグスト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "August"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あっ、師匠！\u3000はい、バッチリ完成ですよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, Master! Yes, it's working perfectly!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "見事だ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well done."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アウグスト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "August"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "えへへ、あとはこれを神官長に売り込んで、\n水不足は解決、報酬もうはうは……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hehe, now I just need to pitch this to the High Priest. We'll solve the water shortage AND rake in the rewards..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そのことだがな。\n１つお前に話さなければならないことがある",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "About that. There's something we need to discuss."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アウグスト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "August"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うは？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "こっちへ来い",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Come with me."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アウグスト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "August"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "やあ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hello there."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シトリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citrine"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あんた！\u3000どの面下げて……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You! How dare you show your face...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まあ、落ち着いてよ。さっきのことは謝るからさ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Now, now, calm down. I'm here to apologize for earlier."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シトリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citrine"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ぬぬぬ……というか、なんで師匠とシトリンが一緒に？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Nnngh... Wait, why are you with my master?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それはだな……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well, you see..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アウグスト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "August"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "このろ過装置をシトリンが作ったことにする！？\n意味わからないんですけど！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We're going to pretend Citrine made this filtration device!? That makes absolutely no sense!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お前自身も言っていたように、これを実際に\n稼働させるには、神官長の同意を得る必要がある",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "As you yourself said, we need the High Priest's approval to implement this."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アウグスト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "August"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "だが、天命に背く行いを看過してはくれないだろう。\nましてや、これが一度目ではないのだから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "However, they won't overlook actions that defy your divine calling. Especially since this isn't your first offense."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アウグスト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "August"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うぐ……それはそうですけど……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ugh... that's true, but..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "その点、僕は元より問題解決を請け負っていた\nなんでも屋なわけだし、話が早いはずだよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Moreover, I've already been hired to solve this problem. It'll be much simpler this way."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シトリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citrine"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "もちろん、報酬はほぼ君の取り分でいい。\n仲介費くらいはちょこっともらうけどね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Of course, you'll get most of the reward. I'll just take a small fee for acting as intermediary."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シトリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citrine"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はあ！？\u3000全部アタシの取り分でしょ！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What!? The whole reward should be mine!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……それなら、こう言い換えてもいい。\n君の錬金術のことを黙っている口止め料だとね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Or we could call it hush money. For keeping quiet about your alchemy."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シトリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citrine"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "もう錬金術のことも全部話す！\u3000実績をあげたんだから\n許可してもらうという線で説得を……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'll just tell them everything about the alchemy! Now that I've proven its worth, I can convince them to approve it...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それは無理だ。天命のしきたりは、過去一度も\n変えられたことがないという",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's impossible. The traditions of divine calling have never been changed. Not once in our history."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アウグスト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "August"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "天命のしきたり……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The traditions of divine calling..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お前がこれからも錬金術を続けたいと思うなら、\n言う通りにするがいい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "If you wish to continue practicing alchemy, you should do as we say."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アウグスト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "August"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私はお前を認めている。錬金術を教え終わるまで、\n万が一、お前と引き離されてしまっては困るのだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I acknowledge your skill. I can't risk being separated from you before I've finished teaching you alchemy."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アウグスト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "August"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（もし錬金術がなくなったら、アタシは……）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(If I lost alchemy, I would...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "っ……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "少し考える時間をやる。\n決意が固まったら、またアトリエに来い",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'll give you some time to think it over. Come back to the atelier once you've made your decision."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アウグスト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "August"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]